# dist/ holds emcc/em++ build droppings. The three artifacts below are
# tracked so the WASM preview that ships in the repo always matches the
# source state — there is no separate publish step for preview.html, so
# committing the built outputs is the only way reviewers see the rendered
# fonts without installing emsdk. `ttf_blobs_wasm.cpp` is the
# auto-generated companion to gen_font_blobs.py; checked in alongside
# the wasm so the dist/ directory is self-consistent.
dist/*
!dist/btclock_datahandler.js
!dist/btclock_datahandler.wasm
!dist/ttf_blobs_wasm.cpp
